.TH SAMPLE-STATS 1
.SH NAME
sample\-stats \- Shows the savings.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample stats\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the savings.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fIstring\fR
The window, for example 7d.
Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fIstring\fR
Group the rows by this column.
Default: day.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fIbool\fR
Colour the output.
Default: true.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
